{"id":"n5c8uza4u59ovt7hcy94x4xki","title":"零初始化优化中的 GCC 异常行为","originalTitle":"Zero-initialisation shenanigans","summary":"GCC 在处理零初始化时表现出异常行为，如多次调用 `memset` 和不必要的内存复制。例如，GCC 14 版本会两次调用 `memset`，而 GCC 15 及更高版本则仅调用一次，但某些边缘情况仍未解决。这些异常优化行为反映了编译器在处理特定初始化模式时的复杂性。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://napcakes.nekoweb.org/posts/zero-init/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T18:04:27.210Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T18:32:55.570Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T18:32:55.570Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","GitHub"],"score":39,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"8de8f141-0c3d-4304-99ca-5d7ac03ac4fa","title":"GCC在零初始化优化中发现重复调用memset的异常行为"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"8de8f141-0c3d-4304-99ca-5d7ac03ac4fa","title":"GCC在零初始化优化中发现重复调用memset的异常行为"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fsljwAImdB3s","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}